msgstr "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Import an OpenQASM 2 program into Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"OpenQASM 2 프로그램을 Qiskit으로 가져오기 {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-into-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two functions import OpenQASM 2 programs into Qiskit.\n"
"These are [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), which takes a filename, and [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), which takes the OpenQASM 2 program as a string.\n"
msgstr ""
"OpenQASM 2 프로그램을 Qiskit으로 가져오는 함수가 두 가지 있습니다.\n"
"파일 이름을 인수로 받는 [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load)와, OpenQASM 2 프로그램을 문자열로 받는 [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads)입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"자세한 내용은 [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2)를 참조하세요.\n"
"- Review the [Verify your program](/guides/debugging-tools) topic.\n"

